\code{\link[=restore_table_version]{restore_table_version()}} inside the range appears as the table's
creation. Values are compared before they are formatted for display:
numbers show 15 significant digits, timestamps are in UTC, and a missing
value shows as \code{NA}. \code{NA} and \code{NaN} compare equal.
